            "short": "$\\dfrac{1}{6x}$",
            "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2x}-\\frac{1}{3x}&=\\frac{3}{6x}-\\frac{2}{6x}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6x}\\end{aligned}$$",
